      "about": "A dynamic professional with 13.5 + \nyears of experience in Automation Testing(Selenium & Appium), Azure DevOps, Quality Management across Mobile Apps & Web Apps.\n\nGood Exposure of building Automation Framework via Page Object design pattern, Data Driven, Testing. BDD, Keyword Driven.\n\nGood exposure in framework reporting section via HTML Report, Testng Report, Cucumber Report & Extent Report.\n\nHands on in integrating Browser stack in framework to run the tests in cloud devices & browsers.\n\nCapabilities to complete successful Functional & Non-Functional POC which helped Organization to diversify towards quality of Test Product.\n\nInvolved in several POC & deliverable wrt Penetration Testing by using Burp Suite, Frida, Netsparkar.\n\nGood Exposure and strong knowledge of jira and Agile methodologies.\n\nHands on in Continuous Integration tools in automation framework like GitHub, Jenkins.\n\nHaving good working knowledge in Agile Methodology project & VV Model Project.\n\nHands On knowledge in creating different test documents like Test Plan, Test Strategy, Configuration Management Plan, Knowledge Management Plan, Defect Prevention Plans, Manual Test Cases, Test Scenario, Test Data, Automation Test Case, OS Release Documents, Tractability Matrix.\n\nHands on exposure on project management tools like TFS & JIRA.\n\nExpertise in testing in Android & iOS platform apps also Web Applications.\n\nIndividual Performer in Automation Testing ,Server testing,API Testing(Rest & Web Services),Database Testing.\n\nExposure in SIP Technology,Debugging SIP logs through Wireshark tool.Hands on experience in VoIP based calls in Software.\n\nGood Exposure in testing different Codecs(Audio & Video) configuration in Server to Application.\n\nInvolved in Interoperability testing which involves testing whether a given software program or technology is compatible with others and promotes cross-use functionality.\n\nStrong in finding small & Critical issues refer regression testing skills in mid releases to track issues in early stages and enthusiastic in learning new technologies at a rapid pace.\n\nGood communication and interpersonal skills, self motivated, team facilitator and fast learner.",
